{"about_the_game":"Experience the beauty and detail of mowing the Great British countryside in Lawn Mowing Simulator, the only simulator that allows you to ride an authentic and expansive roster of real-world licensed lawn mowers from prestigious manufacturers; Toro, SCAG and STIGA as you manage your mowing business.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICALLY AUTHENTIC LAWN MOWING EXPERIENCE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/0505e00d1386854a6ae5ab3b6e719c37.poster.avif?t=1761138497\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/0505e00d1386854a6ae5ab3b6e719c37.webm?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/0505e00d1386854a6ae5ab3b6e719c37.mp4?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Execute ground checks, set your blade height, and measure your engine load as you complete a variety of contracts across Career Mode, Free Mode or Challenge Mode. Take your mowing further with several attachments from stripe rollers, mulching kits, grass collectors, recyclers, flail decks and more.</ul></h2></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAUTIFUL RURAL BRITISH COUNTRYSIDE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/ba213919ec17d7d1ed5d084e87e489cc.poster.avif?t=1761138497\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/ba213919ec17d7d1ed5d084e87e489cc.webm?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/ba213919ec17d7d1ed5d084e87e489cc.mp4?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Lawn Mowing Simulator is set in a beautiful British countryside town. Busy residential streets, vast castle grounds, quaint cottage greens, and large equestrian fields are just some of the locations that await your mowing blades.</ul></h2></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REAL WORLD LICENSED MOWER MANUFACTURERS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/403a52e981f9cf4eb1fbeb959e5ad74d.poster.avif?t=1761138497\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/403a52e981f9cf4eb1fbeb959e5ad74d.webm?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/403a52e981f9cf4eb1fbeb959e5ad74d.mp4?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Toro, SCAG and STIGA front line Lawn Mowing Simulator with their real-world machines painstakingly re-created visually and physically. 12 Mowers are available in the base game, each with their own challenges, attachments and upgrades to pursue.</ul></h2></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCURATE AND ATTENTIVE BUSINESS MANAGEMENT</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/7b86f36045a0e3ec9df18d286ee82ce9.poster.avif?t=1761138497\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/7b86f36045a0e3ec9df18d286ee82ce9.webm?t=1761138497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480560/extras/7b86f36045a0e3ec9df18d286ee82ce9